  "fretX": {
    "why": "FR-062 / research R8. Uniform: equal spacing, x_n = n / N (ASSUMPTION: the spec says only 'uniform'; flagged). Proportional: equal-tempered fret distance from the nut d_n = L * (1 - 2^(-n/12)) (each fret is 2^(1/12) shorter; 12th fret at L/2), normalised so the last fret N is 1: x_n = (1 - 2^(-n/12)) / (1 - 2^(-N/12)). Values below computed by hand (and re-checked numerically) with 2^(-1/12) = 0.943874, 2^(-1/2) = 0.707107, 2^(-1) = 0.5, 2^(-22/12) = 0.280616, 2^(-2) = 0.25.",
    "values": [
      { "fretCount": 22, "fret": 0, "uniform": 0, "proportional": 0 },
      { "fretCount": 22, "fret": 1, "uniform": 0.045455, "proportional": 0.078019 },
      { "fretCount": 22, "fret": 6, "uniform": 0.272727, "proportional": 0.407144 },
      { "fretCount": 22, "fret": 12, "uniform": 0.545455, "proportional": 0.695039 },
      { "fretCount": 22, "fret": 22, "uniform": 1, "proportional": 1 },
      { "fretCount": 24, "fret": 12, "uniform": 0.5, "proportional": 0.666667 },
      { "fretCount": 24, "fret": 24, "uniform": 1, "proportional": 1 }
    ]
